      ],
      "title": "#1 废弃工厂"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3113001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇哦，我们终于进来啦，简直像做梦一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "莉可莉可，你这次真的帮大忙啦，你怎么这么厉害呀~~~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你，你太大声了啦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哈哈哈你这是在害羞吗，真可爱呢～",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "禁声，优纪，这附近说不定有四处巡逻的马仔，我们还不能放松警惕。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "知、知道了，我们继续往前走吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过，你们有没有感觉奇怪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "奇怪？你指什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "一路上我们所到的地方把守得都非常严格。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是，莉可带我们走的这条小路，却意外地一个马仔都没有看到呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "所以说~莉可真是我们的大福星~~~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "别、别这么说啦~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，和江，你怎么一直不说话呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你的直觉很敏锐，优纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯？为什么突然说这个？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你刚才说的一句话，提醒了我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我刚才说什么了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，我刚才一直在夸赞莉可，多亏了她的帮忙，我们才能顺利地来到天启的大本营~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不是这句，是在这之前的那句话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔嗯……我想不起来了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你说，你觉得这里很奇怪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是呀，因为真的很奇怪嘛，为什么别的地方都有严格的把守，这里却空荡荡的一个马仔都没看到呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过，没有马仔把守，对我们来说是个大大的好事，难道不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "问题就在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "莉可，你为什么会知道这样一条隐秘的小路，能够直通天启大本营的里面？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "据我所知，你是第一次来这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "难道不是么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3113029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-139",
