      ],
      "title": "#2 顺利抵达"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3114001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "那个家伙说的没错，你果然是最不好对付的那个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那个家伙？你在说谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "是谁指使你把我们骗进天启大本营的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "指使……？骗……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你们在说什么啊……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪过来，站在我身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊？哦，好……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "既然你们已经识破了，那我就直说了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你们最好乖乖放弃抵抗，这样遭受的损失是最少的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "莉可，你、你真的……一直都在欺骗我们吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "没错，我就是在骗你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "谁要你们那么蠢，竟然那么容易就上当了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，你先走，我来断后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "听我的，走！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好、好的，我等你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你们，一个都走不了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "莉可突然从身后拿出了一颗炸弹，当着优纪、和江的面把它扔向了天空，爆裂的炸弹引起巨大的轰鸣。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "哼哼，终于等到了，我们走！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "就是她们吗？给我抓起来——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小坦克",
          "text": "是！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你们干什么，放手啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "啧啧啧，尽管数量不多，成色倒还不错。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "少废话，我已经按你们说的做了，快带我去见那家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "哼，拽什么拽，跟我来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "给我看好咯，这两个小姑娘狡猾得狠，别让她们溜了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小坦克",
          "text": "是是是，保证寸步不离地盯着她们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呜，和江，你还好吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……无碍。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们该怎么办……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不要怕，我在你身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我来想办法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3114035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……嗯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
