          ],
          "sectionId": 3114
        }
      ],
      "title": "#3 她的真面目"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3115001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "狩、狩猎者大人，我把她们带来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "乖，今天想要什么奖励呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "不，还是不了吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "嗯？你这是在拒绝我的意思吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "不不不不不……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "属下绝对不敢拒绝狩猎者大人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "为狩猎者大人做事，本就是应该的，不需要什么奖励！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你这张嘴巴，真是令人讨厌不起来呢，呵呵呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "留下她们，你们退下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小手雷",
          "text": "……是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我们又见面了，对我精心准备的“欢迎”仪式还满意吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "欢迎来到被遗弃的玩具的乐园，我的小可爱们~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哼，怎么又是你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "当然是因为……我很想念你们，你们又不愿意来，我只好想办法把你们“请”过来，我说的对不对呢，莉可小可爱？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "别用那么恶心的称呼叫我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "哦，我忘记了，你不太喜欢这么直白的表达方式，真是个容易害羞的孩子呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "少废话，你要我做的事，我已经做到了，你也该兑现你答应过我的事了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "嗯？是什么事情呢，我答应过你什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你说过，如果我把优纪、和江骗到这里来，就给我、给我……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "给你什么……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你、你不可以这样！我们说好了的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你说过在我把优纪、和江带到这里之后，会给我一次试用“神秘涂料”的机会！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "哦，原来你是在说那个啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你、你不会反悔了吧……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "怎么可能呢，呵呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我会依照诺言，让你试用一次“神秘涂料”。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "真的么？！太好了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "“神秘涂料”……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3115031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "那是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-141",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
