      ],
      "title": "#4 魔王的交易"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3116001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "那个“神秘涂料”真的有你说的那么神奇吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "真的可以……改变手办的记忆？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "是的哦，神秘涂料能够根据你的需要，随意修改手办的记忆，呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "有没有觉得很美好，用了这个神秘涂料，就可以忘记一切不开心的，只留下最开心的记忆……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我、我相信你，快把神秘涂料交给我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "不要心急嘛，打断淑女的谈话可是不礼貌的哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "除了按照你的心意修改记忆，我的神秘涂料还能增强手办的战斗能力呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "还能增强战斗能力……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "对，没错，你想要的，它都会给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "这世界上最迷人的琼浆玉液，会把我们“手办”变得更加地美丽、更加地——强大！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "来吧！更加地渴望它、沉醉它，为它疯狂吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你，愿意和我一起享受它的美妙了么，我的甜心？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你搞错了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你说……什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我说，我不是要给自己用。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我想把这个神秘涂料，送给我最好的朋友，可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "嗯……不想自己用，反而要送给好友吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我还是第一次遇到你这样的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "不过，也不是不可以，只是，你真的想明白了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "嗯，想明白了，我会把这个世界上最宝贵的东西送给樱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "很好，很好，我会如你所愿，呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "等等，你刚刚提到了樱，樱她现在在哪里？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "就在这里哦，你们待会就能见到她了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "莉可，你真的太让我失望了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3116027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "………………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-142",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
