      ],
      "title": "#5 神秘涂料？"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3117001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "快进去！别磨磨蹭蹭的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘶……好疼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "别碰我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "就就就烦你们这些喜欢长得漂亮脑子还好使的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "别别别想逃出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "进了这里还有逃得出去的么，嘿嘿嘿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "那那倒倒倒倒是没有见过，可可可可以来来来来一个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "闭上你的乌鸦嘴，你不想在这里混，我还想呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "太太太太无聊了，每每每天这这这么重复。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "嗨呀，谁说不是呢，听说皮可鲁和牙牙那两个家伙在搞什么乐透。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "乐乐乐透？好好好好像很好玩的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吃枣药丸",
          "text": "走，我们也看看去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "这里……原来囚禁着这么多的手办……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……那个是不是樱？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "樱，以后不可以随便跟着那些坏蛋走哦，刚才真是太危险了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "来，我这里有一颗棒棒糖，送给你吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "嗯嗯，谢谢两位姐姐，樱现在没事啦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……樱？是你吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "嗯？谁在叫我呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真的是你啊，樱，我们是跟莉……不，我们是来救你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "只救樱一个吗，那樱不要……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱喜欢水咲姐姐和桃乐丝姐姐，她们不走的话，樱也不会走的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你这孩子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "咦，水咲和桃乐丝，真的是你们？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "嗨，又见面了，你们两个还真是形影不离呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "优纪、和江，能见到你们真好~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "彼此彼此，我们也很高兴能和你们重逢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "如果地点不是天启的大本营就更好了，哈哈哈~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你们怎么会被关在这里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "说来话长，我和桃乐丝与你们分别后，一直在四处旅行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "我们两个，几乎环游了整个M城哦，嘿嘿~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "提到这个我就生气，这家伙擅自定了一个环游M城的计划，我们当时只剩废弃工厂这一个地方还没有去过。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "一开始我不愿意，桃乐丝一直坚持，结果就到这里来了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "原来如此……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "天启把你们抓起来关在这里，是要做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "谁知道呢，它们整天神神秘秘的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "不过，我倒听说它们似乎在研制一种涂料……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "是不是叫作“神秘涂料”？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "对对，就是这个！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桃乐丝",
          "text": "最近见它们加快了动作，更多的手办被抓了进来，想必涂料的研制有进展了吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3117041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我有种不好的预感……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
